2214:   convention (see `program-env`); without it the output is the native one.\"\n2237:                     ;; only so the native defn lowering can yield to it.\n2293:                                      ;; `cell/authentic?` — the issuer's\n2338:                                          (if (cell/authentic? dsg__candidate)\n2340:                                                  (cell/get dsg__candidate)\n2503:   map stays for the `library-opts`/`unit-opts` fixtures and the prelude's\n2949:(def unit-opts\n2956:   :native vm/primitive-profiles})\n3064:   the guest library they need, compiled unmodified under `unit-opts`\n3079:         program (compile-program (concat source library) true unit-opts)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
